WEBVTT

00:29.127 --> 00:33.677
<i>I got Rudeus for my fifteenth 
birthday present.</i>

00:34.577 --> 00:39.377
<i>It wasn't quite like we promised, 
but we belong to each other now.</i>

00:41.517 --> 00:43.017
So small...

00:46.317 --> 00:50.257
<i>But I'm always relying on him, 
never giving back.</i>

00:51.697 --> 00:55.327
<i>I'm not worthy of Rudeus.</i>

01:09.207 --> 01:12.297
Eris...

02:26.677 --> 02:28.097
What's that?

02:28.097 --> 02:29.077
Who's there?

02:28.477 --> 02:29.547
Isn't that...

02:29.547 --> 02:30.547
Is that...

02:30.547 --> 02:32.067
Ghislaine?

02:32.777 --> 02:34.367
Stop practice!

02:34.367 --> 02:36.347
Everyone to the Hall of the Now.

02:44.147 --> 02:49.027
<b>III</b>

02:44.147 --> 02:49.027
<b><i>Mushoku Tensei</i></b>

02:44.147 --> 02:49.027
<b><b><i>Jobless Reincarnation</i></b></b>

03:07.397 --> 03:10.627
Hey there, Ghislaine. 
Still alive and kicking?

03:10.917 --> 03:12.917
It's good to see you again, Master.

03:13.617 --> 03:18.517
I figured you'd be dead in a ditch 
by now, but you don't look half bad.

03:18.977 --> 03:20.887
Now, who's that next to you?

03:20.887 --> 03:23.077
This is my student, Eris.

03:23.077 --> 03:25.837
I brought her because I want 
you to train her, Master.

03:28.227 --> 03:29.587
Her?

03:31.347 --> 03:34.157
I haven't got time for 
small fry like you!

03:36.907 --> 03:39.177
How dare you speak to 
the master like that!

03:39.177 --> 03:40.227
On your knees!

03:40.227 --> 03:43.197
You're in the presence of 
the Sword God Gal Farion!

03:43.197 --> 03:45.267
What has Ghislaine been teaching you?!

03:45.267 --> 03:47.257
What did she come back with you for?!

03:47.257 --> 03:49.577
Yeah! She needs proper discipline!

03:48.197 --> 03:50.877
Take care of your students yourself!

03:50.097 --> 03:51.517
Leave here at once!

03:51.517 --> 03:52.127
Quiet.

03:53.507 --> 03:55.577
I like the look in your eyes.

03:56.007 --> 03:58.297
Who're you out to kill?

03:58.297 --> 03:59.807
The Dragon God.

03:59.807 --> 04:01.707
Dragon God Orsted!

04:02.437 --> 04:03.727
The Dragon God?

04:02.807 --> 04:04.387
You mean <i>the</i> Dragon God?

04:03.297 --> 04:04.387
Ridiculous.

04:03.837 --> 04:05.887
One of the Seven Great Powers?

04:04.377 --> 04:06.307
What does she mean, "Orsted"?

04:04.967 --> 04:08.007
As if anyone would dare challenge him.

04:06.307 --> 04:08.007
Just about no one alive knows 
the Dragon God's name.

04:09.897 --> 04:11.187
I see!

04:11.187 --> 04:14.707
You're right. Compared to 
Orsted, I am small fry!

04:14.707 --> 04:18.157
Well, well, well. 
So, you're out for <i>his</i> blood!

04:18.647 --> 04:22.147
I can't believe I'm not 
the only one after him!

04:27.417 --> 04:31.677
But you know, anyone can talk big.

04:31.677 --> 04:33.177
Can you pull it off?

04:33.177 --> 04:34.287
I will!

04:41.677 --> 04:43.387
Fine. I'll see what you can do.

04:43.387 --> 04:45.437
Why give the likes of her a chance?!

04:43.387 --> 04:44.317
What?!

04:44.027 --> 04:45.517
Gino, take her on.

04:46.077 --> 04:47.267
Y-Yessir!

04:47.557 --> 04:49.877
He's the youngest we've got.

04:49.877 --> 04:52.767
Still wet behind the ears, 
but he knows his stuff.

04:58.827 --> 05:00.157
Move to the center of—

05:17.107 --> 05:19.127
What'd I tell you? 
Still wet behind the ears.

05:19.827 --> 05:21.597
You're right about that.

05:22.407 --> 05:24.797
Okay. Nina, you're next.

05:25.487 --> 05:26.517
Yes, sir!

05:26.887 --> 05:29.237
This time, wait until you face off first.

05:29.237 --> 05:30.387
Nothing wrong with a surprise attack,

05:30.387 --> 05:33.537
but show me what you can 
do after the signal, too.

05:48.947 --> 05:49.957
I'll kill you.

05:51.607 --> 05:52.707
Begin!

06:16.957 --> 06:18.457
E-Enough!

06:18.457 --> 06:19.447
Stop!

06:38.377 --> 06:40.957
Is everyone here this soft?!

06:40.957 --> 06:42.447
Y-You dare?!

06:42.327 --> 06:43.797
Enough of your nonsense!

06:42.447 --> 06:43.967
Are you trying to insult us?!

06:43.957 --> 06:45.127
Know your place!

06:44.217 --> 06:46.057
You call that swordsmanship?!

06:45.617 --> 06:49.167
My bad. Guess I misjudged you a little.

06:51.177 --> 06:53.227
I'll take you on.

06:53.227 --> 06:55.407
You needn't trouble yourself, Master.

06:55.407 --> 06:56.267
Allow me.

07:02.287 --> 07:06.237
Don't panic. I'll go easy on you.

07:06.237 --> 07:08.787
Hey, that's a nice sword 
you've got there.

07:08.787 --> 07:11.067
That's gotta be the great Julian's work.

07:11.067 --> 07:12.277
Don't ask me.

07:12.277 --> 07:14.497
I got it from the Migurd.

07:14.497 --> 07:15.757
Oh, okay.

07:22.607 --> 07:25.127
I've got another Julian right here.

07:37.557 --> 07:38.567
Here I come.

07:59.077 --> 07:59.907
Magnificent!

07:59.657 --> 08:00.877
Magnificently struck!

07:59.907 --> 08:00.877
Magnificent!

08:00.227 --> 08:01.507
Eris!

08:04.257 --> 08:05.547
Eris...

08:17.707 --> 08:20.397
Ghislaine, patch Eris up.

08:22.397 --> 08:24.777
As of today, she's a Sword Saint.

08:24.777 --> 08:27.557
Starting tomorrow, 
I'll teach her the blade.

08:29.777 --> 08:30.997
Master!

08:31.407 --> 08:36.287
Sword Saint is a title reserved for those 
who have mastered the Blade of Light!

08:36.287 --> 08:38.837
That boorish brat has no right—

08:40.017 --> 08:43.727
She took down two brats who have 
mastered the Blade of Light.

08:43.727 --> 08:45.087
That's good enough.

08:45.087 --> 08:46.317
B-But—

08:46.317 --> 08:51.167
You don't get to be Sword God because 
you learned some special trick.

08:51.547 --> 08:55.277
I don't get special treatment, 
and I <i>am</i> special,

08:55.277 --> 08:58.697
so why should I make a big deal 
about you measly Sword Saints?

09:00.937 --> 09:03.557
My humble apologies.

09:28.907 --> 09:30.597
Is that all you've got?

09:42.127 --> 09:46.517
Come on, you're in a fight. You think you 
have time to think about anything else?

09:53.977 --> 09:56.067
Just empty your mind 
and swing your sword.

09:56.497 --> 09:58.337
Empty your mind, swing your sword,

09:58.337 --> 10:01.017
and when you get tired, 
sit, rest, and think.

10:01.017 --> 10:05.157
When you get tired of thinking, 
get back up and swing your sword.

10:12.007 --> 10:14.597
Does Ghislaine really know how to write?

10:14.897 --> 10:19.697
She says so, but we've got no way to check, 
since no one here can read.

10:19.697 --> 10:21.987
I bet she's lying.

10:21.987 --> 10:24.267
Why would Dad train <i>her?</i>

10:26.437 --> 10:30.507
Hey, you! You've got more talent 
for brawling than swordsmanship!

10:31.097 --> 10:32.037
You can say that again!

10:34.597 --> 10:36.967
Say something, Gino.

10:39.537 --> 10:43.997
Eris, want to join in our 
group training for a change?

10:43.997 --> 10:46.037
What?! Are you out of your mind?!

10:46.037 --> 10:49.297
<i>She's</i> training directly under 
my dad, under the Sword God!

10:49.297 --> 10:50.837
Doesn't that frustrate you?

10:50.837 --> 10:53.727
I... I mean, I did lose to her.

10:53.727 --> 10:57.127
Only because the way she fought 
was beneath the Sword God Style!

10:57.127 --> 10:59.487
You'd be more than a match 
for her in a proper duel!

10:59.777 --> 11:00.927
I don't know.

11:18.107 --> 11:20.807
Swinging a sword sure is tough.

11:28.727 --> 11:30.907
Ghislaine is faster.

11:30.907 --> 11:33.017
Ruijerd is faster.

11:33.457 --> 11:35.667
The Sword God is faster.

11:35.907 --> 11:39.577
And Orsted is way faster than this!

11:40.607 --> 11:42.317
Way faster...

11:57.957 --> 12:00.977
How did the Sword God move, again?

12:08.127 --> 12:09.337
Fingertips.

12:10.697 --> 12:11.717
Shoulder.

12:16.577 --> 12:17.817
That's not right.

12:39.777 --> 12:41.157
Rudeus...

13:41.317 --> 13:42.887
I'm still not even close.

13:55.987 --> 13:57.697
Hello!

13:57.937 --> 14:00.077
Anybody home?!

14:00.077 --> 14:01.817
Hello!

14:02.977 --> 14:06.137
Oh, good. Someone is here.

14:06.777 --> 14:09.297
I am the North Emperor, Auber Corbe—

14:08.667 --> 14:09.747
Move.

14:11.337 --> 14:13.297
What's wrong with her?

14:13.297 --> 14:14.537
You're in my way.

14:15.597 --> 14:18.707
I am called Auber the Peacock Blade.

14:18.707 --> 14:20.917
I see you are a practitioner 
of the Sword God Style.

14:21.247 --> 14:23.767
If you would inform the Sword God 
of my arrival, I would be much—

14:23.767 --> 14:25.907
I'm telling you to move.

15:30.667 --> 15:32.077
That's enough.

15:32.537 --> 15:33.577
Oh!

15:34.067 --> 15:36.597
It's been too long, Sword God.

15:43.697 --> 15:45.847
Good to see you, North Emperor.

15:46.177 --> 15:49.467
I received your letter.

15:49.467 --> 15:52.517
I was en route to your training hall,
 when this girl...

15:52.827 --> 15:56.237
Never have I seen one so 
ferocious with a blade.

15:56.237 --> 15:58.187
She's practically a wild animal—

15:58.187 --> 16:02.207
Oh, is this the "Mad Dog" you mentioned?

16:02.207 --> 16:03.667
Yeah, that's her.

16:25.807 --> 16:27.357
Welcome back, Eris.

16:49.947 --> 16:53.167
Master, why won't you 
teach Eris anything?

16:53.167 --> 16:54.747
I did teach her.

16:54.747 --> 16:56.767
How to do practice swings?

16:56.767 --> 16:59.587
No, how to train.

16:59.847 --> 17:04.167
You always told us to do 
everything rationally!

17:04.167 --> 17:05.327
I sure did.

17:05.327 --> 17:07.127
Then what are you doing with Eris?

17:07.127 --> 17:11.997
What's rational about doing practice 
swings every day like it's all she knows?

17:12.637 --> 17:16.137
It's been years, and she still 
can't perform the Blade of Light.

17:16.137 --> 17:18.437
Why don't you teach her?

17:18.437 --> 17:23.067
Since when have you been 
such a pain in the ass?

17:23.067 --> 17:25.607
Since before I came back here!

17:28.097 --> 17:31.527
Are you too good to listen 
to your master anymore?

17:31.937 --> 17:33.147
But—

17:33.827 --> 17:40.477
Ghislaine, I've got a few 
regrets about your education.

17:40.477 --> 17:46.577
You were like a hungry tiger. 
Now you're a toothless kitten.

17:46.577 --> 17:51.597
If you'd stayed how you were, 
you'd be a Sword Emperor by now.

17:56.377 --> 17:59.527
I'm done pulling teeth.

18:01.027 --> 18:02.637
I don't understand.

18:02.637 --> 18:04.707
Why won't you train her?!

18:04.707 --> 18:07.047
I can't help pitying Eris, 
the way you treat her!

18:09.127 --> 18:10.847
Listen, Ghislaine.

18:10.847 --> 18:15.497
If you want to surpass me, keep being 
rational, and you'll pull it off someday.

18:15.497 --> 18:19.747
But she's got her sights 
set on Dragon God Orsted.

18:20.407 --> 18:23.957
He's beyond reason.

18:24.327 --> 18:27.967
What I can teach her will 
never be enough to beat him.

18:32.947 --> 18:37.197
Look, Ghislaine, 
training isn't the same as practice.

18:37.197 --> 18:41.797
And if you've got a goal, there's no 
point just following instructions.

18:41.797 --> 18:42.617
Right?

18:43.097 --> 18:46.167
You always talk in riddles, Master.

18:46.167 --> 18:47.867
I don't get it.

18:48.937 --> 18:53.677
Well, basically, she needs more 
than just lessons from me.

18:54.567 --> 18:56.617
This guy will make a good start.

18:56.957 --> 19:00.467
I am the North Emperor, Auber Corbett.

19:00.467 --> 19:02.707
Some call me the Peacock Blade.

19:04.137 --> 19:06.127
What's the North God Style want here?

19:06.127 --> 19:08.817
The Sword God invited me.

19:08.817 --> 19:12.057
He wishes me to instruct 
one of his students.

19:12.057 --> 19:14.087
Why the North God Style?

19:14.087 --> 19:17.497
Their underhanded tricks 
won't suit Eris at all.

19:17.877 --> 19:20.007
The Dragon God will use them on her.

19:21.647 --> 19:24.297
Just who is this Dragon God?

19:24.297 --> 19:25.927
Hell if I know.

19:25.927 --> 19:30.487
But he has every move in Sword God,

19:30.487 --> 19:34.677
North God, and all the 
other styles down cold.

19:34.677 --> 19:38.417
He'll counter any move she tries, of course,
and he'll use them himself.

19:38.847 --> 19:43.027
So, she'll never fight him on even 
footing unless she learns them, too.

19:43.417 --> 19:47.667
I see. Then, you'll invite the 
Water God Style, too, at some point?

19:47.987 --> 19:50.237
Yeah. I've already sent the letter.

19:50.757 --> 19:51.807
Is that so?

19:54.697 --> 19:58.297
In that case, North Emperor, 
make yourself at home.

19:58.717 --> 20:00.767
Thank you, Sword King.

20:00.767 --> 20:02.687
Much obliged.

20:05.927 --> 20:10.697
Your ferocious welcome the other 
day gave me quite a thrill.

20:10.697 --> 20:15.567
Allow me to test the 
Mad Dog's skill once more.

20:17.797 --> 20:18.437
Begin!

20:44.737 --> 20:48.617
I... I need to get stronger.

20:48.617 --> 20:51.907
Strong enough to be sure 
I can stand level with Rudeus.

20:51.907 --> 20:53.907
And who is Rudeus?

20:53.907 --> 20:58.227
I'm the sword fighter. 
Rudeus is the mage.

21:01.237 --> 21:02.927
Rudeus is...

21:06.697 --> 21:08.957
amazing!

21:29.447 --> 21:31.077
Would you look at that?!

21:31.077 --> 21:32.847
A Blade of Light if I've ever seen one!

21:32.847 --> 21:35.907
Her speed and power leave 
nothing to be desired.

21:36.367 --> 21:37.887
Wow...

21:45.107 --> 21:46.367
Yes, indeed.

21:46.367 --> 21:49.227
You struck a truly brilliant blow.

21:49.927 --> 21:53.507
Do you feel up to another round?

21:55.687 --> 21:57.257
Of course!

22:01.967 --> 22:04.967
Episode 1
Burn Bright, Mad Dog

23:34.977 --> 23:39.987
Next Time
Howl, Mad Dog
